---
// 钩子图：同一个模型经三种判分协议得到三个分数；±10pp 是单模型置信区间不是分差容差
---

<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 252" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <marker id="evh-arw" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#94a3b8"/></marker>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="320" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">同一个模型，为什么能拿三个分？</text>

      {/* 模型 */}
      <rect x="40" y="96" width="110" height="60" rx="10" fill="#d9eef3" stroke="#0085a1" stroke-width="1.6"/>
      <text x="95" y="122" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">同一个模型</text>
      <text x="95" y="140" font-size="9" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">同一套基准题</text>

      {/* 三个判分器 */}
      {[
        {y:48, t:"likelihood", s:"比选项 logprob", c:"#7fc3d8", sc:"#0085a1", v:"86"},
        {y:96, t:"生成匹配", s:"生成字母再匹配", c:"#fde2b8", sc:"#e6a23c", v:"90"},
        {y:144, t:"CoT 生成", s:"思维链+精确匹配", c:"#e4f5ec", sc:"#0f9d68", v:"83"},
      ].map((n)=> (
        <g>
          <line x1="150" y1="126" x2="205" y2={n.y+22} stroke="#94a3b8" marker-end="url(#evh-arw)"/>
          <rect x="208" y={n.y} width="150" height="44" rx="8" fill={n.c} stroke={n.sc}/>
          <text x="283" y={n.y+18} font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">{n.t}</text>
          <text x="283" y={n.y+33} font-size="8.5" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">{n.s}</text>
          <line x1="358" y1={n.y+22} x2="420" y2={n.y+22} stroke="#94a3b8" marker-end="url(#evh-arw)"/>
          <rect x="424" y={n.y} width="70" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke={n.sc} stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <text x="459" y={n.y+29} font-size="16" font-weight="bold" fill={n.sc} text-anchor="middle">{n.v}</text>
        </g>
      ))}

      <rect x="514" y="70" width="108" height="112" rx="10" fill="#f4f6f8" stroke="#cbd5e1"/>
      <text x="568" y="94" font-size="9.5" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">数字为示意</text>
      <text x="568" y="114" font-size="9" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">协议不同，</text>
      <text x="568" y="128" font-size="9" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">分数不可横比</text>
      <text x="568" y="152" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" fill="#b14a4a" text-anchor="middle">±10pp 是单模型</text>
      <text x="568" y="166" font-size="9" font-weight="bold" fill="#b14a4a" text-anchor="middle">95% 置信区间</text>

      <text x="320" y="220" font-size="10" fill="#475569" text-anchor="middle">分数 = 模型能力 × 判分协议 × 题目集 × 推理配置（× 为共同决定，不是数学乘法）</text>
      <text x="320" y="238" font-size="9" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">两模型分差的容差在不同题集上约为 ±14pp；同题配对时只看「你对我错」的不一致对</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
